<title>HUNGARY: Hungary June budget gap HUF 165bln vs May's 150bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary June budget gap HUF 165bln vs May's 150bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deficit of Hungary's central state budget rose to 165 billion forints in June from 150 billion forints in May, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>BUDGET (BLN FORINTS)</p>
<p>		  Jan-June 97   Jan-May 97   Jan-June 96</p>
<p>  REVENUES	1,102.0	 933.9	     905.0</p>
<p>  EXPENDITURES  1,267.0     1,083.9	   1,027.0</p>
<p>  BALANCE	  -165.0	-150.0	    -122.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures do not include one-off revenues, e.g. privatisation revenues.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
